== row model: rows and lists
ok a new row has one value per data field
ok a new row is all null
ok the row list owns its rows, a view does not
ok Add returns the index
ok Count after Add and Insert
ok Insert keeps the order
ok IndexOf
ok Remove returns the old index
ok the view lost one row
ok the row list is unaffected by the view
ok a row removed from a view still exists
ok Delete
ok a deleted row is not found
ok Clear
== state machine: open and close
ok a new dataset is inactive
ok Active is False
ok Close on an inactive dataset does nothing
ok Open sequence
ok an open dataset is in dsBrowse
ok Active is True
ok RecordCount
ok IsEmpty is False
ok after Open: Bof
ok after Open the cursor is on the first row
ok Open on an active dataset does nothing
ok Close sequence
ok a closed dataset is inactive
ok dynamic fields are gone after Close
ok rows are released by Close
ok Active := True is Open
ok Active := True on an active dataset does nothing
ok Active := False is Close
== state machine: row ids and view
ok row ids count from 1 in load order
ok without a filter the view has the same rows
ok the row id counter restarts at Open
== state machine: closed dataset
ok RecordCount on a closed dataset
ok IsEmpty on a closed dataset
ok CheckBrowseMode on a closed dataset
ok Bof and Eof can be read on a closed dataset
ok FindField on a closed dataset without persistent fields
ok FieldDefs can be read on a closed dataset
== state machine: empty dataset
ok RecordCount of an empty dataset
ok IsEmpty
ok empty: Bof and Eof
ok empty: no cursor row
== state machine: failures during open
ok DriverOpen fails
ok nothing after the failing DriverOpen, no DriverClose
ok the dataset stays inactive
ok DriverInitFieldDefs fails
ok resources are released
ok DriverLoadRows fails
ok resources are released after a failing load
ok the dataset stays inactive after a failing load
ok dynamic fields created so far are destroyed
ok rows loaded so far are released
== state machine: handlers that raise
ok BeforeOpen raises
ok nothing happens after the handler
ok the open was cancelled
ok AfterOpen raises
ok the open itself is complete
ok the dataset is open
ok BeforeClose raises
ok nothing happens after the handler
ok the close was cancelled
ok AfterClose raises
ok the close itself is complete
== state machine: Active while loading
ok Active := True while loading is only remembered
ok still inactive while loading
ok Loaded opens the dataset
ok active after Loaded
== state machine: destruction
ok destroying an active dataset closes it first
ok no events when the owner is being destroyed
ok destroying an inactive dataset fires nothing
failed checks: 0
